{"format":"kards-original-reference","version":1,"id":"32ece29f90b2531c","name":"card_unit_m3a3_honey_desert","package":"/Game/Blueprints/Cards/Britain/ToW/units/card_unit_m3a3_honey_desert","parent":"UBaseCardObject","card":{"title":"M3A3 HONEY","text":"When you draw a card, your HQ gains +1 defense.","flavorText":"The M3A3 Honey was a Stuart V tank, an American light tank that was produced during WWII. The tank was manufactured between 1941-1944 and a total of 22,744 units were built, including variants and its successor the M5. The tank was called Stuart after the Civil War Confederate General J.E.B. Stuart, but the crews nicknamed it Honey due to its smooth ride. The M3A3 had an improved hull (copied from M5 to the M3 series), and a new turret that could fit a SCR-508 radio. The M3A3 had a crew of 4 (commander, gunner, driver and assistant driver), a main armament of a 37 mm gun M6 and a secondary armament of 3 x .30 caliber (7.62 mm) Browning M1919A4 machine guns.","faction":"Britain","type":"tank","rarity":"Uncommon","cost":2,"operationCost":1,"attack":2,"defense":3},"defaults":{"UberGraphFrame":{},"Name":"card_unit_m3a3_honey_desert","title":{"Namespace":"card_britain","Key":"card_unit_m3a3_honey_desert_title","SourceString":"M3A3 HONEY","LocalizedString":"M3A3 HONEY"},"Type":"ETypeEnum::tank","attack":2,"defense":3,"range":1,"faction":"EFactionEnum::Britain","kredits":2,"Text":{"Namespace":"card_britain","Key":"card_unit_m3a3_honey_desert_text","SourceString":"When you draw a card, your HQ gains +1 defense.","LocalizedString":"When you draw a card, your HQ gains +1 defense."},"flavorText":{"Namespace":"card_britain","Key":"card_unit_m3a3_honey_desert_history","SourceString":"The M3A3 Honey was a Stuart V tank, an American light tank that was produced during WWII. The tank was manufactured between 1941-1944 and a total of 22,744 units were built, including variants and its successor the M5. The tank was called Stuart after the Civil War Confederate General J.E.B. Stuart, but the crews nicknamed it Honey due to its smooth ride. The M3A3 had an improved hull (copied from M5 to the M3 series), and a new turret that could fit a SCR-508 radio. The M3A3 had a crew of 4 (commander, gunner, driver and assistant driver), a main armament of a 37 mm gun M6 and a secondary armament of 3 x .30 caliber (7.62 mm) Browning M1919A4 machine guns.","LocalizedString":"The M3A3 Honey was a Stuart V tank, an American light tank that was produced during WWII. The tank was manufactured between 1941-1944 and a total of 22,744 units were built, including variants and its successor the M5. The tank was called Stuart after the Civil War Confederate General J.E.B. Stuart, but the crews nicknamed it Honey due to its smooth ride. The M3A3 had an improved hull (copied from M5 to the M3 series), and a new turret that could fit a SCR-508 radio. The M3A3 had a crew of 4 (commander, gunner, driver and assistant driver), a main armament of a 37 mm gun M6 and a secondary armament of 3 x .30 caliber (7.62 mm) Browning M1919A4 machine guns."},"operationCost":1,"rarity":"ERarityEnum::Uncommon","cardSet":"ECardSetEnum::Campaign2020","isInPermanentPool":true,"showBoostIcon":true,"EffectType":"ECardEffectTypes::Trigger","usedTriggers":["ERegisteredCardFunction::OnOtherCardDrawnFromDeck"],"soundEnterPlay":{"ObjectName":"SoundWave'Armored_Car_Move_New'","ObjectPath":"kards/Content/Assets/Audio/Units/Armored_Car_Move_New.0"},"soundMoveToFrontline":{"ObjectName":"SoundWave'Armored_Car_Move_New'","ObjectPath":"kards/Content/Assets/Audio/Units/Armored_Car_Move_New.0"},"soundAttack":{"ObjectName":"SoundCue'AU_Tank_cannon_medium_fire_Cue'","ObjectPath":"kards/Content/Assets/Audio/Projectiles_and_Impacts/Tanks/AU_Tank_cannon_medium_fire_Cue.0"},"soundBlowUp":{"ObjectName":"SoundWave'AU_ArmorExplosion_01'","ObjectPath":"kards/Content/Assets/Audio/Explosions/AU_ArmorExplosion_01.0"},"Image":{"AssetPathName":"/Game/Assets/Textures/Images/Britain/TheatersOfWar/t_honey.t_honey